# Home Run Contest: Jigglypuff fetches the bat, hops over Sandbag, short hops
# backwards into it and Rests from the right side. From that side the bag is
# sent left, comes back and stays on the platform with 28%. She wakes up with
# the bat still in hand and forward smashes it. Roughly 560 ft.
# Run with MELEE_BOOT_SCENE=homerun MELEE_BOOT_CHARACTER=15, or `just hrc-demo`.
seed 0x00000001
ports 1

# The match loads and GO lands near frame 84.
wait 100

# Walk to the bat. A dash runs her off the left edge (x = -40), and she spends
# the first 12 frames turning around. She stops at x = -38.9.
p1 stick -60,0 x40
wait 8
p1 A x2
wait 16

# Full hop over the bag, landing at x = 14 facing right, so the bag is behind her.
p1 X stick 127,0 x10
p1 stick 127,0 x22
wait 20

# Reverse short hop Rest: X held 2 frames is inside the 5 frame jumpsquat.
# It connects at frame 228. The Rest has to come first: at 14% the bag bounces
# back too hard and leaves the platform.
p1 X stick -127,0 x2
p1 stick -127,0 x6
p1 B stick 0,-127 x3

# Asleep at x = -4. The bag settles at x = 28.9 by frame 435. Input before
# frame 487 is eaten.
wait 258

# Walk into tip range and swing. The bat smash is not chargeable. Hit at 541.
p1 stick 60,0 x22
wait 4
p1 A stick 127,0 x3

# Flight, landing and the result.
wait 560
